@Users_API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5076

### Registrar usuario
POST {{Users_API_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Lucia",
  "apellido": "Perez",
  "email": "lucia@test.com",
  "password": "Prueba123!"
}


### Iniciar sesión
POST {{Users_API_HostAddress}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lucia@test.com",
  "password": "Prueba123!"
}

### Registro con datos inválidos
POST {{Users_API_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Lucia",
  "apellido": "Perez",
  "email": "correo-invalido",
  "password": "Prueba123!"
}

### Login con contraseña incorrecta
POST {{Users_API_HostAddress}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lucia@test.com",
  "password": "Incorrecta123"
}